# Build artifacts and local-only files that must not go into the Docker build context.
#
# A .dockerignore pattern without `**` is anchored at the context root, so a bare `target/`
# missed `impl/rust/target` and `impl/rust/target-worktrees` — tens of gigabytes of host build
# output shipped into every image build, which is slow and fills the builder's disk (a build
# then fails with "no space left on device", or exports an image the daemon cannot find).
**/target/
**/target-*/
**/build/
# dist/
connectors/*/.venv/
connectors/*/output/
cloud/*/.venv/
cloud/*/output/
